            </div>
            <pb/>
            <div type="div2">
               <head>LITTLE FOLKS.</head>
               <p rend="justify">Large Quarto, printed in red and black, on thick, heavy paper, and unsurpassed for style of printing by any American publication. New and delightful moral stories, with comic Illustrations.</p>
               <div type="div3">
